-- SHADOW-SEMANTICS S2-DECL (d): `hub` re-exports `IA.mth : Debug b => a -> b ->
-- String` (impl `Int`) and `IB.mth : Eq b => a -> b -> String` (impl `Bool`).  At
-- `mth True 3` both declared types match and only `IB Bool` selects, but `IB.mth`
-- has its own `Eq b` constraint, and an occurrence of a spelling two interfaces
-- declare records no method-level dictionaries.  So the located
-- `T-AMBIGUOUS-METHOD` names the selected declaration and its constraints, in
-- either hub order (`swapped.mdk`), rather than an engine running `mth` without
-- its `Eq` dictionary.
import hub.{IA, IB, mth}

main = println (mth True 3)
